+    /// map-1 pp0/1, the even packed-FMA opcodes, the odd-but-packed
+    /// vfmsubadd 97/A7/B7, the VNNI pp-tricks in map 2, the packed
+    /// vmovsldup (pp2 12) / vmovshdup (pp2 16), and the packed
+    /// scalar-control rows (26/54/56/08/09).
